00:13:23.965 --> 00:13:25.725
And so we compared

00:13:25.725 --> 00:13:28.205
that, we put in a definition for that.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:38.260
Down here, it talks about the public being a building structure uses which are open to the public and owned by or under the exclusion

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:42.420
