00:14:38.315 --> 00:14:45.035
>> Thank you, Mr. Chairman. Mr. Chairman and members of the Andover Planning and Zoning Commission, thank you for allowing me to speak.

00:14:45.435 --> 00:14:55.580
As you know, the Planning and Zoning Commission is empowered by state law and the town of Andover Charter to act as a combined planning commission as well as a zoning commission.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:15:04.860
The commission acts with the legislative authority when it writes regulations and creates land use law for the town of Andover.

00:15:05.575 --> 00:15:08.055
As the former chairman of that commission,

00:15:08.295 --> 00:15:12.215
I appreciate your efforts in reviewing what is before you tonight.

00:15:13.095 --> 00:15:15.575
The town of Andover applied

00:15:15.735 --> 00:15:17.655
to the Planning and Zoning Commission

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:22.400
to change the regulations in the Andover Rural Design District.

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.880
This is the town's primary,

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.280
but not only residential district.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:33.520
Although most of Andover's buildings and properties are located in this district,

00:15:33.975 --> 00:15:36.295
our current zoning regulations

00:15:36.535 --> 00:15:40.935
do not allow for buildings or uses in this zoning district.

00:15:41.335 --> 00:15:43.415
The town seeks to change this.

00:15:44.215 --> 00:15:45.815
Put very simply,

00:15:46.215 --> 00:15:47.255
our goal

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.320
is to allow municipal uses

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:54.480
via special permit in the Andover rural design.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.160
That's it.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.880
This means that when the town wants to construct something in the residential district,

00:16:01.355 --> 00:16:04.955
it would submit a special permit application to the Commission.

00:16:05.275 --> 00:16:09.275
The Commission then reviews and determines compliance with regulations

00:16:09.515 --> 00:16:11.435
through its executive powers.

00:16:12.875 --> 00:16:20.960
The Planning and Zoning Commission is required to hold a public hearing on the application so that everybody can have their opinions heard.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.680
By requiring a special permit,

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:28.480
the Commission retains the full executive authority to rule on applications.

00:16:29.435 --> 00:16:31.995
This is how the system is supposed to work.

00:16:32.875 --> 00:16:35.595
In submitting this proposal for a zone change,

00:16:35.915 --> 00:16:37.995
I propose the simplest change

00:16:38.315 --> 00:16:40.555
that would accomplish the town's goal.

00:16:41.115 --> 00:16:44.235
Like all other zone changes, the town zoning attorney,

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.770
attorney Mark Brantz

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.730
reviews

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:49.650
the documentation.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:54.770
Attorney Brantz then recommended some additional changes to be made concurrently.

00:16:56.705 --> 00:17:07.905
In no way is the town trying to change the way the regulations of of the town of Andover treat the Andover Elementary School or the Andover Board of Education

00:17:08.225 --> 00:17:09.425
or transfer

00:17:09.425 --> 00:17:11.425
authority from one entity

00:17:11.505 --> 00:17:12.145
to another.

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.480
An awful lot of people have misconstrued

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.520
this somehow

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:22.120
as diminishing the authority of the school board or making schools somehow illegal.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.280
That was neither the intent

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:27.000
nor what the proposal would do.

00:17:27.855 --> 00:17:33.375
Subsequent to that, the Board of Education hired their own zoning attorney to review the proposed change,

00:17:33.775 --> 00:17:37.615
and then the zoning attorneys for the town and Board of Ed discussed

00:17:37.615 --> 00:17:38.655
those changes.

00:17:39.295 --> 00:17:41.295
And I'm happy to support the changes

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.900
that were recommended by the Board of Education's

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:45.700
attorney.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.380
That's it, and I thank you for your time and consideration.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:52.740
Okay. Thank you, Eric.

